<title>UK: SuedwestLB sets 100 mln mark bond with warrants.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB sets 100 mln mark bond with warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWEST LANDESBANK CAPITAL MARKETS</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     2.25	MATURITY    21.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.975   PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    STUTT     DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL AND PUT OPTIONS ON MARK AND U.S. DOLLAR.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
